Complete local Java example; the app itself does not execute it:
```java
import java.util.concurrent.CompletableFuture;
public class Main {

  public static void main(String[] args) {
    var result = CompletableFuture.completedFuture(4)
        .thenApply(n -> n * 2).thenApply(n -> "score=" + n);
    System.out.println(result.join());
  }
}
```

